1. Report ID Parameter

Use ?report_id=123 to load a specific report directly
Example: /django_plotly_dash/app/TiterAnalysisApp/?report_id=42

2. Embedded Mode Parameter

Use ?embedded=true to hide the Create Report and Select Report buttons
Also prevents the Select Report modal from auto-opening
Example: /django_plotly_dash/app/TiterAnalysisApp/?embedded=true

3. Combined Parameters

You can use both parameters together
Example: /django_plotly_dash/app/TiterAnalysisApp/?report_id=42&embedded=true